      <title>Lenny - the road to release</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Debian</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;With the archive now frozen, the Lenny release isn&amp;#39;t far away. What does this mean for the average developer?&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk introduces the Release Team, the policies behind freezes, removals, binNMUs, and general release management in Debian.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
